                <pb facs="0727" n="633" sameAs="frus:frus1924v02/pg633"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">871.6363/231: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Riggs</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-10-09T19:00:00+01:44"><hi rendition="#italic">October 9,
                                1924—7 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received October 9—6:15
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>67. Department’s 42, October 7, 4 p.m. Today I communicated orally to Minister
                    for Foreign Affairs substance of telegram under reference. He said he would take
                    matter up with Minister of Industry and Commerce and he believed a solution
                    would be reached satisfactory to the American Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Riggs</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
